if you and Mashiki came.

00:01:33.344 --> 00:01:35.680
You're unbelievable.

00:01:35.888 --> 00:01:37.682
Yeah, but...

00:01:40.310 --> 00:01:43.521
| got to see her, so whatever.

00:01:45.815 --> 00:01:47.191
| think it's starting soon.

00:01:47.400 --> 00:01:48.568
Yeah.

00:02:28.107 --> 00:02:30.360
