00:05:08.976 --> 00:05:09.936
One of those?

00:05:10.144 --> 00:05:11.229
At school. Those big ones.

00:05:11.437 --> 00:05:13.773
Oh, those things that say "congratulations"?

00:05:13.981 --> 00:05:15.358
--You mean a banner?
--Yeah, that.

00:05:15.566 --> 00:05:17.944
You know everything, class rep!

00:05:19.070 --> 00:05:22.031
You two aren't participating this year?

00:05:22.240 --> 00:05:23.074
Nah.

00:05:23.282 --> 00:05:24.659
We'll be starting next year.

00:05:24.867 --> 00:05:26.369
Come see us then.

00:05:26.577 --> 00:05:29.038
What? Towa, didn't you say you'd be made

00:05:29.247 --> 00:05:31.457
a regular right away when
you joined the team?

00:05:31.666 --> 00:05:34.502
Well, you know, you have
to respect the third-years.

00:05:34.710 --> 00:05:38.965
I'm planning to make my
glorious debut next year.

00:05:47.849 --> 00:05:49.392
Class rep, you taking the train?

00:05:49.600 --> 00:05:50.476
I'm taking the bus.

00:05:50.685 --> 00:05:52.353
Then I'll walk you to the bus stop.

00:05:52.562 --> 00:05:53.604
What about you, Mashiki-chan?

00:05:53.813 --> 00:05:54.480
Me, too.

00:05:54.689 --> 00:05:56.649
The bus? Okay, let's go.

00:05:56.858 --> 00:05:58.651
I'm fine.

00:05:58.860 --> 00:06:00.903
It's right there.

00:06:01.863 --> 00:06:04.073
Now, now. Let's go together.

00:06:04.282 --> 00:06:05.408
Besides, it's close, right?

00:06:05.616 --> 00:06:07.618
I'm fine, really. Goodbye.

00:06:07.827 --> 00:06:09.161
Class rep!

00:06:09.370 --> 00:06:10.955
See you later.

00:06:15.376 --> 00:06:17.587
She's no fun.

00:06:18.254 --> 00:06:20.131
It's because you're too persistent.

00:06:20.339 --> 00:06:22.133
It's not like that.

00:06:22.341 --> 00:06:23.384
What?

00:06:30.057 --> 00:06:31.893
Mihashi-san.

00:06:32.643 --> 00:06:33.686
Is something wrong?

00:06:33.895 --> 00:06:35.187
What?

00:06:35.396 --> 00:06:42.528
Uh, well... I thought something
might have happened with Honda-kun.

00:06:46.866 --> 00:06:49.327
Yeah. Yeah.

00:06:49.535 --> 00:06:55.124
Yeah, it's fine. I won't be out that late.

00:06:55.333 --> 00:06:58.336
Yeah, I'm okay.

00:07:00.129 --> 00:07:02.882
| know.

00:07:03.090 --> 00:07:05.885
Just for today, please.

00:07:06.093 --> 00:07:08.429
Okay, bye.

00:07:09.889 --> 00:07:12.600
--Did your parents say it's okay?
--Yeah.

00:07:12.808 --> 00:07:14.477
Sorry for inviting you over so suddenly.

00:07:14.685 --> 00:07:15.686
It's fine.

00:07:15.895 --> 00:07:16.896
I'm glad you did.

00:07:17.104 --> 00:07:19.857
Today's the last day I'll be able to relax.

00:07:20.066 --> 00:07:22.985
Starting tomorrow, I need
to focus on my studies.

00:07:28.157 --> 00:07:31.535
| don't really understand it myself.

00:07:31.744 --> 00:07:34.246
For some reason, things have been different.

00:07:34.455 --> 00:07:36.707
"Different"? How?

00:07:42.797 --> 00:07:44.632
He bothers me.

00:07:47.009 --> 00:07:50.096
You're interested in Honda-kun.

00:07:50.304 --> 00:07:54.725
No! How could anyone like that slob?

00:07:55.351 --> 00:07:59.522
But I think he might be a nice person.

00:07:59.730 --> 00:08:04.235
He was probably just
worried about you earlier.

00:08:10.074 --> 00:08:11.742
Mashiki-san, you're lucky.

00:08:11.951 --> 00:08:13.452
What?

00:08:45.401 --> 00:08:46.277
Good morning.

00:08:46.485 --> 00:08:49.196
You may be on summer break,
but you slept in late.

00:08:49.405 --> 00:08:51.282
Welcome home.

00:08:52.283 --> 00:08:53.617
You're back, huh?

00:08:53.826 --> 00:08:57.371
I'm leaving for work again soon, though.

00:08:57.580 --> 00:08:59.457
| made breakfast.

00:09:01.417 --> 00:09:04.336
You could've stayed in bed.

00:09:04.545 --> 00:09:08.090
Let me be a mother to you sometimes.

00:09:08.299 --> 00:09:09.300
Okay.

00:09:09.508 --> 00:09:12.428
| can't inconvenience Mishima-kun's
mother all the time.

00:09:12.636 --> 00:09:13.888
Are you working again tonight?

00:09:14.096 --> 00:09:17.641
Yeah. Your stepfather will be
getting off work tomorrow morning,

00:09:17.850 --> 00:09:19.602
so he said he might stop by.

00:09:19.810 --> 00:09:22.730
Sorry, I have practice tomorrow.

00:09:22.938 --> 00:09:23.939
Really?

00:09:24.148 --> 00:09:25.441
Well, I'm off.

00:09:25.649 --> 00:09:27.568
See you later.

