00:10:15.950 --> 00:10:18.953
"Honda-kun"

00:10:21.330 --> 00:10:22.164
Hello?

00:10:22.373 --> 00:10:23.415
Hey.

00:10:23.624 --> 00:10:25.251
Are you free right now?

00:10:25.459 --> 00:10:26.210
What do you want?

00:10:26.418 --> 00:10:29.964
U-Uh, do you want to go see the fireworks

00:10:30.172 --> 00:10:31.966
tomorrow?

00:10:32.174 --> 00:10:34.176
Not with everyone, but just the two of us.

00:10:34.385 --> 00:10:36.178
| thought I repaid the favor.

00:10:36.387 --> 00:10:39.598
It won't be a favor this time.

00:10:39.807 --> 00:10:41.183
No?

00:10:44.395 --> 00:10:46.605
I'll be right down!

00:10:46.814 --> 00:10:48.649
| have cram school tomorrow.

00:10:48.858 --> 00:10:51.735
What about the day after that?

00:10:51.944 --> 00:10:54.864
Or the day after that?

00:10:55.072 --> 00:10:56.824
Isn't the fireworks display tomorrow?

00:10:57.032 --> 00:10:58.159
No.

00:10:58.367 --> 00:11:01.078
It's just an excuse.

00:11:04.498 --> 00:11:06.917
| want to see you.

00:11:16.135 --> 00:11:19.430
I'm busy all break.

00:11:21.056 --> 00:11:23.267
Sorry.

00:11:46.582 --> 00:11:50.294
Sorry I'm late.

00:12:04.183 --> 00:12:09.647
Um, tomorrow...

00:12:11.273 --> 00:12:14.526
Never mind. It's nothing.

00:12:32.586 --> 00:12:39.718
"Kato: I'm going to wear a yukata, too. Mukai:
I'm looking forward to it. Honda: I'll go."

00:12:54.858 --> 00:12:57.027
"Boys in Glasses 2"

00:13:00.030 --> 00:13:03.409
"Dreams, Love, and That Boy"

00:13:38.861 --> 00:13:42.156
All right, take a ten-minute break.

00:13:51.874 --> 00:13:52.666
Huh?

00:13:52.875 --> 00:13:54.168
What are you doing?

00:13:54.376 --> 00:13:56.462
| was going to say hi.

00:13:56.670 --> 00:13:57.338
Jeez.

00:13:57.546 --> 00:14:00.215
You're about to get wet anyway.

00:14:00.424 --> 00:14:02.509
So, what are you guys doing?

00:14:02.718 --> 00:14:03.510
"You guys"?

00:14:03.719 --> 00:14:06.138
You're not going to see the
fireworks with Mashiki?

00:14:06.347 --> 00:14:07.514
I'm babysitting Akira.

00:14:07.723 --> 00:14:09.600
That's a shame.

00:14:09.808 --> 00:14:11.977
What about you?

00:14:12.728 --> 00:14:13.896
She turned me down.

00:14:14.104 --> 00:14:15.272
What?

00:14:20.194 --> 00:14:21.945
| don't get it.

00:14:23.530 --> 00:14:26.116
She's kind of scary.

00:14:27.910 --> 00:14:30.079
This isn't like you.

00:14:34.083 --> 00:14:37.127
Hey, stop! I can't breathe!

00:14:41.423 --> 00:14:42.049
Later.

00:14:42.257 --> 00:14:43.967
Yeah.

00:14:55.062 --> 00:14:56.688
Mashiki!

00:15:05.197 --> 00:15:07.658
It's on me.

00:15:07.866 --> 00:15:09.034
--Are you sure?
--Yeah.

00:15:09.243 --> 00:15:10.619
Thanks.

00:15:15.666 --> 00:15:16.875
That's cold.

00:15:17.084 --> 00:15:19.711
It's not summer without these.

00:15:19.920 --> 00:15:22.631
Haruki's always eating popsicles.

00:15:22.840 --> 00:15:24.633
| wonder if they upset his stomach.

00:15:24.842 --> 00:15:26.885
Mishima-kun does eat them a lot.

00:15:27.094 --> 00:15:30.472
| see you've been watching him closely.

00:15:31.515 --> 00:15:34.184
Hey, were you okay the other day?

00:15:34.393 --> 00:15:37.146
Did any weirdos bother you at the bus stop?

00:15:37.354 --> 00:15:38.564
No, it was fine.

00:15:38.772 --> 00:15:41.692
Really? That's good.

00:15:42.943 --> 00:15:44.820
We had tea at my house after.

00:15:45.028 --> 00:15:47.239
Ah, for girl talk?

00:15:47.448 --> 00:15:51.952
You guys are close, huh? That's a relief.

00:15:54.788 --> 00:15:57.458
Honda-kun, you're a nice person.

00:15:57.666 --> 00:16:00.878
Could you tell the class rep that?

00:16:01.086 --> 00:16:05.466
She seriously hates me these days.

00:16:06.216 --> 00:16:07.509
She doesn't hate you!

00:16:07.718 --> 00:16:09.928
She does.

00:16:24.234 --> 00:16:25.861
Listen.

00:16:27.029 --> 00:16:31.867
Mihashi-san knows. Probably, anyway.

00:16:32.075 --> 00:16:37.414
| think she just can't work up the courage.

00:16:38.916 --> 00:16:45.464
She wants to believe you, but she's
having trouble being honest about it.

00:16:45.672 --> 00:16:53.138
In shojo manga, the heroine tells
the boy she likes that she hates him.

00:17:01.688 --> 00:17:03.732
Mashiki, do you know where
the class rep lives?

00:17:03.941 --> 00:17:05.817
What? Uh, yeah.

00:17:06.026 --> 00:17:07.611
Tell me.

00:17:48.318 --> 00:17:54.992
So, uh... a quick date until
cram school is nice, too.

00:17:55.200 --> 00:17:57.202
That's random.

00:18:10.882 --> 00:18:12.342
Don't you have to go?

00:18:12.551 --> 00:18:15.304
Being with you is more important.

00:18:22.394 --> 00:18:23.478
Don't tease me.

00:18:23.687 --> 00:18:24.980
What?

00:18:28.191 --> 00:18:30.152
You're bothering me.

00:18:31.695 --> 00:18:34.990
Tease you? Are you being serious?

00:18:35.198 --> 00:18:37.492
Do you really not get it?

00:18:40.287 --> 00:18:45.000
I've been serious this whole time.

00:18:47.753 --> 00:18:48.629
What do you want to eat?

00:18:48.837 --> 00:18:49.504
Candied apples.

00:18:49.713 --> 00:18:50.547
| want a hot dog.

00:18:50.756 --> 00:18:51.923
Why don't we get kebabs?

00:18:52.132 --> 00:18:53.091
What? Kebabs?

00:18:53.300 --> 00:18:55.260
--Ugh, aren't those...?
--Yeah, but I want meat.

00:18:55.469 --> 00:18:57.346
Huh? Honda?

00:18:57.554 --> 00:18:59.389
--It's been forever!
--Hey.

00:18:59.598 --> 00:19:01.808
What are you doing here?
Do you live around here?

00:19:02.017 --> 00:19:04.603
Look at my yukata. Isn't it cute?

00:19:04.811 --> 00:19:06.813
Yeah, it's all right.

00:19:07.022 --> 00:19:08.523
Seriously?

00:19:08.732 --> 00:19:11.443
Forget it. Don't you guys have to go?

00:19:11.652 --> 00:19:15.614
Actually, the boys we were supposed
to meet said they'd be late.

00:19:15.822 --> 00:19:17.908
We thought we'd go without them.

00:19:18.116 --> 00:19:19.117
It's a girls' night out.

00:19:19.326 --> 00:19:22.287
Since he's already here,
let's invite Honda to tag along.

00:19:22.496 --> 00:19:24.623
--Yeah, good ideal!
--What do you mean, tag along?

00:19:24.831 --> 00:19:26.583
Exactly what it sounds like.

00:19:26.792 --> 00:19:28.877
--Come on, let's go.
--Just go.

00:19:29.086 --> 00:19:30.045
Like we used to.

00:19:30.253 --> 00:19:31.922
You're no fun.

00:19:32.130 --> 00:19:33.548
We can scoop goldfish together.

00:19:33.757 --> 00:19:34.925
Good idea.

00:19:35.133 --> 00:19:36.760
Class rep!

00:19:38.095 --> 00:19:39.179
Sorry, bye.

00:19:39.388 --> 00:19:40.722
What?

00:19:52.693 --> 00:19:54.820
Are your feet okay?

00:19:55.028 --> 00:19:57.572
Sorry. We were still talking.

00:19:57.781 --> 00:20:00.033
Forget about it.

00:20:01.535 --> 00:20:03.620
What's wrong?

00:20:05.997 --> 00:20:07.833
| don't know.

00:20:08.041 --> 00:20:12.129
Just don't bother me anymore.

00:20:12.337 --> 00:20:15.090
Don't say you're serious
as if it's no big deal.

00:20:15.298 --> 00:20:18.969
--But |-
--I'm different!

00:20:19.177 --> 00:20:23.181
I'm not as straightforward as those girls.

00:20:23.390 --> 00:20:25.559
I'm not cute, either.

00:20:25.767 --> 00:20:27.185
I'm totally different.

00:20:27.394 --> 00:20:29.604
| don't mind.

00:20:39.156 --> 00:20:41.616
You're fine just the way you are.

00:20:41.825 --> 00:20:43.118
It's totally fine.

00:20:43.326 --> 00:20:45.746
| like how serious you are.

00:20:47.581 --> 00:20:50.041
| like you, class rep.

00:20:56.882 --> 00:20:59.009
| like you.

00:21:15.150 --> 00:21:18.528
Hey, what about you?

00:21:20.030 --> 00:21:21.823
| don't.

00:21:24.075 --> 00:21:26.119
Me, too.

00:21:57.692 --> 00:21:59.861
It's starting!

00:22:10.539 --> 00:22:19.047
Another city light blinks out

00:22:19.256 --> 00:22:28.890
Seems I'm the only one
being left behind like this

00:22:29.099 --> 00:22:37.607
I leaned in close to the light
of the vending machine

00:22:37.816 --> 00:22:46.741
And bought something
other than my usual coffee

00:22:46.950 --> 00:22:51.413
I wonder if I can be myself

00:22:51.621 --> 00:22:57.460
From now on, and even further beyond

00:22:58.587 --> 00:23:07.554
Surely someday we'll come
to know sadness as love

00:23:07.762 --> 00:23:16.897
Reconnecting somewhere
and parting again, over and over

00:23:17.105 --> 00:23:30.660
Surely the day will come when we're
all too used to feeling joy

00:23:30.869 --> 00:23:37.208
Call that happiness

